      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "If you want to reproduce this, there's a specific avatar (search for \"nanachi pub\" world and select the avatar inside holding the bottle of beer below the straw hat one) that was broken in this way with the recent update. Clear your cache, select this avatar and you load in as generic error (and other people see you as generic error). Latest public version of VRChat.",
