  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Like the Title says.\n\nI expirienced it yesterday when loading mine or other Peopels Avatars they dont load and after 2 Minutes go to the Generic Error Avatar.\n\nI have no idea whats up whit that but i also found out that Restarting your VRChat fixes it Temporarily, eventualy it comes back.\n\nIt just ruins something Great, when someone wants to show of there Avatar and boom some peopel just see an Error Avatar so pls fix it.",
